# Terminal-style MCP/tool loop demo for docs/demo-agent-loop.gif
# Regenerated via scripts/generate_demo_gifs.py (Cursor UI capture can replace later).

Output docs/demo-agent-loop.gif
Set FontSize 15
Set Width 980
Set Height 520
Set Theme "Catppuccin Latte"
Set TypingSpeed 40ms
Set Padding 16

Type "# Agent tool loop (MCP)"
Enter
Type "ste_check_text(BEFORE) → findings"
Enter
Sleep 1.5s
Type "ste_suggest_rewrite(...) → rewrite brief"
Enter
Sleep 1.5s
Type "apply brief → AFTER steps"
Enter
Sleep 1.5s
Type "ste_check_text(AFTER) → length/passive cleared"
Enter
Sleep 2s
